    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Built in 1860, this property carries over a century and a half of Mountcharles history within its walls. As one of the older homes on Main Street, it retains the charm and character of its era, offering buyers a rare opportunity to own a piece of the village`s heritage while still enjoying the space and potential of a substantial three storey layout and an unusually large garden.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen - 5.6m (18'4\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nWalls painted, Laminate Flooring, 2no. Window, 1no. Radiator, High & Low level units tiled between, Wash hand basin, Electric Hob & Oven\n\nSitting room - 5.6m (18'4\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nWalls painted, Carpeted flooring, 1no. Bay Window, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Open Fireplace with Granite Fireplace\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.2m (13'9\") x 1m (3'3\")\nWalls painted, Laminated flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Built in Storage\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Built in Storage\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBathroom - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Wash hand basin, WC, Shower over bath\n\nAttic room - 3.7m (12'2\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\n1no. Velux\n\nAttic room - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\n1no. Velux\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
